〔113 統測〕 

▲閱讀下文，回答第 48-50 題

參考圖(八)C/C++ 語言的程式碼，回答下列題組問題。

```c
#include <stdio.h>
int multiple (int c) {
    return c * 2;
}
int main() {
    int X = 5;
    int Y = 4;
    int city = 3;
    X = X - city;
    Y = multiple(city);
    if (city % 4 == 1)
        printf("臺北");
    else if (city % 4 == 2)
        printf("臺中");
    else if (city % 4 == 3)
        printf("雲林");
    else
        printf("高雄");
    return 0;
}
```

